OL,3,GNEWSACounty receives #570k to tackle
OL,4,Aabuse and stalking
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than #500,000 has been allocated
OL,7,Ftowards tackling domestic abuse and
OL,8,Fstalking in Northamptonshire.
OL,10,FThe Home Office funding has been
OL,11,Fring-fenced for intervention schemes
OL,12,Faimed at addressing abusive behaviour,
OL,13,Freducing reoffending and improving
OL,14,Foutcomes for victims.
OL,16,FIt was secured by police, fire and
OL,17,Fcrime commissioner Danielle Stone and
OL,18,Fwill be in place until March 2029.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
